                "text": "After Democrats pushed Republicans for MONTHS to fix ACA premiums, Americans are now about to fall off a healthcare cliff, and Donald Trump doesn\u2019t even have a concept of a plan to fix it.\n\nWe must extend the ACA premium tax credits NOW to lower healthcare costs for the American people.",
