                "text": "When asked about their plan to fix healthcare, one senior House Republican\u2019s response was:\n\n\u201cWe\u2019re nowhere on healthcare.\u201d\n\nWhat a grim thing to say. But it\u2019s true\u2014Republicans are in total disarray on healthcare.",
